%tr
  %td.flexibleContainerCell{:align => "center", :valign => "top", :width => "620"}
    %div{:style => "text-align:left;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:0;margin-top:3px;color:#000000;line-height:135%;"}
      %p Hi there,
%tr
  %td
    %div{:style => "text-align:left;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:0;margin-top:3px;color:#000000;line-height:135%;"}
      %p We just wanted to touch base as we're missing some content that we need for <strong> #{@community.name} </strong> before we can move into production: Following is the status of what you have submitted so far via Pynwheel Launch.
%tr
  %td.flexibleContainerCell{:align => "center", :valign => "top", :width => "620"}
    %div{:style => "text-align:left;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:0;margin-top:3px;color:#000000;line-height:135%;"}
      %p
        - @forms.each_with_index do |form, index|
          -if form[:status].eql?("Not Provided") || form[:status].eql?("Attention Required")
            #{index + 1}. #{form[:name]} - <strong>#{form[:status]}</strong>
          -else
            #{index + 1}. #{form[:name]} - #{form[:status]}
          %br
%tr
  %td
    %div{:style => "text-align:left;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:0;margin-top:3px;color:#000000;line-height:135%;"}
      %p If you need more time, that's fine! Just let us know. We just wanted to make sure it didn't slip through the cracks. As a reminder, production begins after we have received all content and we have made a successful connection to your data feed. Production typically takes 2-4 weeks. Let us know if you have any questions.
%tr
  %td
    %div{:style => "text-align:left;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:0;margin-top:3px;color:#000000;line-height:135%;"}
